  "//accent": "Two golds, one job each (2026-09-25). FILLS are bright gold (--accent, --accent-solid) with a near-black label (10.6:1) and a gold.700 rim (--accent-edge, 3.35:1 on surface) that carries the non-text contrast — WCAG 1.4.11 asks the component's EDGE to be identifiable, not its fill. Gold as TEXT is --accent-ink / --text-accent (gold.800, >=4.5:1); gold as a THIN LINE or selection indicator is --accent-line (gold.700, >=3:1). Never put --accent itself on text or hairlines in daylight — bright gold on paper is 1.9:1.",
  "accent": {
    "default": { "$value": "{color.gold.400}", "$type": "color" },
    "hover": { "$value": "{color.gold.350}", "$type": "color" },
    "pressed": { "$value": "{color.gold.700}", "$type": "color" },
